msgid "mission.hist_01.title"
msgstr "Commerce Street facades"

msgid "mission.hist_01.summary"
msgstr "Capture all 20 commerce street facades with the handcart, offload atomically, apply privacy masks, fix QC rework, and deliver."

msgid "mission.hist_01.beat.proposal"
msgstr "City Hall needs a clean inventory of all 20 Commerce Street facades."

msgid "mission.hist_01.beat.preparation"
msgstr "Mount the initial camera and basic GNSS on your handcart—no advanced sensors needed."

msgid "mission.hist_01.beat.technical_discovery"
msgstr "Use control targets to adjust your local trajectory; checkpoints are held back solely for final CQ verification."

msgid "mission.hist_01.beat.setback_or_correction"
msgstr "QC flagged blurred facades and an unmasked privacy region—recollect the missing frames and redact thumbnails in the office."

msgid "mission.hist_01.beat.delivery_and_consequence"
msgstr "Deliver the approved bundle once to settle payment and unlock Mission HIST-02."

msgid "mission.hist_02.title"
msgstr "Lost storm drains"

msgid "mission.hist_02.summary"
msgstr "Inventory 12 storm drains on the handcart before announced rain degrades image quality; unlocks the bicycle purchase."

msgid "mission.hist_02.beat.proposal"
msgstr "Locate and photograph 12 blocked storm drains before the afternoon shower rolls in."

msgid "mission.hist_02.beat.preparation"
msgstr "Rain will challenge shutter speed and lens clarity, not trigger an instant mission failure."

msgid "mission.hist_02.beat.technical_discovery"
msgstr "Heavy drops add motion blur and glare—slow down or shorten exposure to preserve usable images."

msgid "mission.hist_02.beat.setback_or_correction"
msgstr "Replace rain-blurred shots inside the office recipe before submitting to CQ."

msgid "mission.hist_02.beat.delivery_and_consequence"
msgstr "City Hall approved the drainage survey and unlocked bicycle purchases in the shop."

msgid "mission.hist_03.title"
msgstr "Accessible sidewalk"

msgid "mission.hist_03.summary"
msgstr "Measure 8 sidewalk width and curb segments by bicycle using supplied local control planes; unlocks the scooter."

msgid "mission.hist_03.beat.proposal"
msgstr "The university needs curb heights and sidewalk widths along eight segments."

msgid "mission.hist_03.beat.preparation"
msgstr "Deploy on the bicycle with the supplied local control targets and reference planes."

msgid "mission.hist_03.beat.technical_discovery"
msgstr "Local control planes tighten relative precision between camera passes even with basic GNSS."

msgid "mission.hist_03.beat.setback_or_correction"
msgstr "Keep independent checkpoints untouched until final CQ checks relative accuracy."

msgid "mission.hist_03.beat.delivery_and_consequence"
msgstr "University CQ passed and unlocked the motor scooter for faster routes."

