msgid "notebook.guide"
msgstr "1. Parallax: a single image provides a ray, not depth. Two different viewpoints must cross with at least 5° of parallax. Turning in place is not enough.\n\n2. Image quality: blur ≤ 3 px, clipping ≤ 20%, lens obstruction ≤ 20%, and visible features are required. Stop for a clear photo.\n\n3. Custody: field photos are not ready for delivery. Unload within 5 m of D, then process within 8 m of O.\n\n4. Quality review: all three façades must be reconstructed; privacy and format checks must pass. New recollection changes field progress, but the office report changes only after processing.\n\n5. This training uses ideal poses and synthetic thumbnails. A green quality result does not measure real-world GNSS accuracy."

